|               | (4) array reshape           | 14,663       | apply array reshape pragmas                                                            |
|               | (5) access patterns         | 14,223       | array access pattern optmizations                                                      |
|               |                             |              |                                                                                        |
| Performance   |                             |              | After transformations are applied to meet performance pragma targets                   |
|               | (1) loop simplification     | 13,770       | loop and instruction simplification                                                    |
|               | (2) parallelization         | 13,758       | loops are unrolled or pipelined to meet performance targets                            |
|               | (3) array partition         | 13,698       | arrays are partitioned to meet performance targets                                     |
|               | (4) simplification          | 13,698       | simplification of design after performance transformations                             |
|               |                             |              |                                                                                        |
| HW Transforms |                             |              | After hardware transfomations                                                          |
|               | (1) lowering                | 13,659       | initial conversion to HW specific instructions                                         |
|               | (2) optimizations           | 13,547       | high level synthesis optimizations                                                     |
